 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/10/07 14:24| 02 | 325| 084| 0299| 0023| 0238| 0379|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/10/07 14:24| 02 | 255| 024| 0245| 0074| 0195| 0437|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/10/06 20:36| 02 | 039| 016| 0204| 0026| 0168| 0244|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/10/06 20:24| 01 | 303| 012| 0339| 0163| 0244| 0726|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/10/06 18:24| 01 | 300| 010| 0399| 0046| 0309| 0434|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/10/06 17:00| 01 | 074| 006| 026"
